    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 0,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "RESOLUTION NO. 9817"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 1,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "A RESOLUTION introduced by City Manager Dr. Robert M. Perez regarding a capital"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 2,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "request for repairs to the York Chiller at Hotel Topeka. 5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 3,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City has received a request from the Topeka Development"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 4,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Corporation (TDC) for funding service elevator repair; and"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 5,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Governing Body acknowledges the request for funding should be"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 6,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "authorized."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 7,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 8,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "CITY OF TOPEKA, KANSAS, that funding for the cost to repair the York Chiller at Hotel"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 9,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Topeka in the amount of $16,289.25 is hereby authorized."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 10,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "ADOPTED and APPROVED by the Governing Body on June 9, 2026."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 11,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "CITY OF TOPEKA, KANSAS"
    },
    {
